[0.102424, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m1. the challenge comes from the ledger, not from us\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.668525, "o", "   round 9c150000000000009d150000...  (ledger_sequence / 720, refused if stale)\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m2. the issuer admits a member: one credential, one root\u001b[0m\r\n"]
